      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While some inflammation is normal after surgery, the combination of tightness and warmth warrants a professional assessment, especially given your concerns. Since the clinic is closed, if you have access to a telehealth service or an urgent care line associated with your surgery, call them immediately for advice. For comfort tonight, you can try elevating your leg above heart level and applying a cold pack, but monitor any worsening symptoms closely.",
